{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right","id":1553694,"title":"We're closing in on the home stretch, right?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-09-08T16:32:32-07:00","id":1553694,"title":"We're closing in on the home stretch, right?","content":"I've got my copies of 3E core, Essence, Dragon-Blooded: WFHW, and Lunars: FatG. Abyssals, Sidereals, Exigents, and Alchemicals are in the pipeline. I read earlier this year that the Infernals crowdfunding campaign was coming this fall; is that still true? And will Liminals and/or Getimians happen next year?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T00:00:03-07:00","id":1553700,"title":"","content":"After the currently running Monster Kingdoms, next is the Curseborne Player's Guide, then it's Infernals. It's just about possible for Infernals to be this year, assuming a two-week gap between campaigns, but if not it'll be first next year.<br /> <br /> Whether Liminals and Getimians will get crowdfunded is up in the air; they're a bit more open to it than in the past, but as yet there's no decision. They'd still get books without a campaign, but they wouldn't have the deluxe books the campaigns offer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T02:40:18-07:00","id":1553704,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not an expert on Exalted, but I think I saw on DTRPG that Abyssals is out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T11:36:28-07:00","id":1553710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1553704#post1553704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m not an expert on Exalted, but I think I saw on DTRPG that Abyssals is out.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is, but they're still sorting out a printer for the deluxe editions (as with the other splatbooks where they're still in the pipeline).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T12:29:03-07:00","id":1553713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1553700#post1553700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whether Liminals and Getimians will get crowdfunded is up in the air; they're a bit more open to it than in the past, but as yet there's no decision. They'd still get books without a campaign, but they wouldn't have the deluxe books the campaigns offer.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is more than somewhat disappointing. Have Onyx Path offered any reasons why the Liminals and Getimians don't rate the deluxe treatment? Is it just getting too expensive? I was really looking forward to my complete set of deluxe books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-09T17:58:23-07:00","id":1553725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hakkonen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1553713#post1553713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have Onyx Path offered any reasons why the Liminals and Getimians don't rate the deluxe treatment?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is hardly new information. The likelihood that those groups of Exalted would not have the same scale of books as the traditional ones has been an understanding for years. Possibly a full decade, at this point.<br /> <br /> The Liminal and Getimian Exalted have interesting premises, sure, but... they don't have the same scope of narrative.<br /> <br /> The big Exalted books are as much about the portion of the setting that surrounds those Exalted as it is about they themselves. But the scale of Liminal stories has always been promoted as smaller, more personal, more unobtrusive in the larger scope of Creation. And Getimians... by definition they have no place in the world.<br /> <br /> So between the two of them, you're missing out on about a chapter and a half to two chapters worth of content by itself. They have no equivalent to the Houses of the Scarlet Dynasty, the Silver Pact and Lunar Dominions, the Bureau of Destiny and Yu-Shan, the kingdoms of the dead, or Autochthonia.<br /> <br /> They're like Exigents, except where you can't fill the book out with Charm development guidelines and being able to give examples of five or six distinct types of them.<br /> <br /> (All of that being said, observe that the comment was that they <i>might</i> not get crowdfunding for deluxe books.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-10T13:43:29-07:00","id":1553739,"title":"","content":"I hope they get kickstarters, simply because the alternative without access to backer manuscripts is basically &quot;you'll see them when you see them&quot; and experience has shown that can be a long time but I recognise they don't have the same scope for backer content that other Exalts did (though thanks to Exalted Essence there are pre-existing Getimian and Liminal PCs).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-11T08:59:21-07:00","id":1553749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1553739#post1553739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope they get kickstarters, simply because the alternative without access to backer manuscripts is basically &quot;you'll see them when you see them&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The option <i>with</i> access to backer manuscripts is &quot;you'll see them when you see them&quot;. Like, I'm not looking at the Infernals book right now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">experience has shown that can be a long time</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that experience has also shown that the time between backer manuscript and full release book is consistently approximately one year.<br /> <br /> But we've already been waiting several times longer than that for these latter day Exalted books, so I think that difference is a bit incidental at this point.<br /> <br /> I would find that the worst consequence of not having crowdfunding for those books is a slightly longer dry spell in between releases featuring rules for playing an Exalted type. But at that point, we'll already be up to seven alternative options, so I think the sting of that is less than it was waiting in between Solars and Dragon-Blooded.<br /> <br /> I would just hope that it isn't a dry spell of all other Exalted content as well.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-30T06:51:19-08:00","id":1555976,"title":"","content":"So, Infernals made it under the wire and will be done with crowdfunding before the end of 2025. I'm definitely hoping to get Getimians sooner rather than later, as I'm still trying to wrap my head around their concept: do they just suddenly appear in Creation one day with memories of another world? And as a fan of Promethean, well, 'nuff said. <br /> <br /> But I don't think that's the finish line. We still need the Rakshasa, the Mountain Folk, and the Dragon Kings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-30T11:37:45-08:00","id":1555986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1555976#post1555976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm definitely hoping to get Getimians sooner rather than later, as I'm still trying to wrap my head around their concept: do they just suddenly appear in Creation one day with memories of another world?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much, as the Getimian Exaltation gives life to a discarded destiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-30T13:47:33-08:00","id":1555998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1553694-we-re-closing-in-on-the-home-stretch-right?p=1555976#post1555976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">do they just suddenly appear in Creation one day with memories of another world?</div> </div> </div> </div>Memories of the world as it could have been had things taken a different course, guided by destiny, at some point in the past.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-01T00:07:50-08:00","id":1556046,"title":"","content":"I could see the Liminal splat book being expanded with a section on shadowlands, to cover how they fit into Creation and how the powers of the Underworld react them and their mysterious patron.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile Getimians aren't from Creation by definition. I'd argue they could get a Exigent style local (akin to Great Folks), probably a bordermarch they are reshaping to resemble the parts of of their lives that did not make it into Creation. A useful logistical hub for their war on Yu Shan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-01T01:17:05-08:00","id":1556048,"title":"","content":"Getimians will probably have some info on Zen-Mu, plus some information on generally what frayed fate looks like. Plus probably a couple new Sidereal styles.<br /> <br /> Liminals has been stated at some point to indeed have more on shadowlands, with I think Sijan getting a write-up in there too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}